OL,3,ANo further action against government
OL,4,Aadviser's wife over Palestine Action
OL,5,Apost, police say
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice say no further action will be
OL,8,Ftaken against the wife of the
OL,9,Fgovernment's national security adviser
OL,10,Fafter she posted on social media
OL,11,Freferencing Palestine Action.
OL,13,FSarah Helm, who is married to Jonathan
OL,14,FPowell, wrote on X on Thursday: "God
OL,15,Fhelp us authors who support Palestine
OL,16,Fand Palestine Action."
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/18
